SoftMatcha-for-Obsidian

The files core/src/upstream/z_*.rs and core/src/helper.rs are derived from
softmatcha/softmatcha2 at b37e104741465a31425db5f07202d8065af7d571,
developed by Masataka Yoneda, licensed under Apache-2.0.
Changes: Python/NumPy bindings removed; ndarray used directly; Unix file I/O
replaced by immutable byte slices; Rayon replaced by sequential iteration;
web-time clock used; small-vocabulary and integer-overflow guards added.
The soft-pattern enumeration and corpus-aware pruning algorithms are retained.
